config HALO_POWER_CUE_SOUND_DURATION_MS
	int "Power cue duration in milliseconds"
	default 60
	range 20 300
	depends on HALO_POWER_CUE_SOUND
	help
	  Playback duration. Kept very short: the cue plays while the button
	  is still held and must be finished well before the shutdown sound
	  if the user releases immediately.

config HALO_POWER_CUE_SOUND_VOLUME
